      <div class="glass-about-box p-5 mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <p class="fs-4 text-light opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
          Hi, I am <span class="pink-text fw-bold">Priyanshi Kumari</span>, an aspiring full-stack developer passionate about turning ideas into interactive and scalable web applications. I enjoy working with modern technologies like JavaScript, React, Node.js, and MongoDB, and I love solving problems through clean code and thoughtful design.
